            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Weft 1.1.32

- Propose checked-in recipe changes for human approval through Requests, with a diff against the approved recipe.
- Add `weft recipe propose --project <id>` and the `recipe_propose` MCP tool.
- Detect repository recipe changes hidden by private recipes and apply them only after approval.
- Deliver runtime recipe reviews to the bell, app badge and macOS notifications; make service recipe review links open approval.
- Show newly approved optional services with their own Start and Stop controls.
]]></description>
